# Stack routing

| Path | Stack | Prefer rules |
|------|--------|--------------|
| `backend/app/Modules/NexaTaxi/` | Laravel NexaTaxi | admin-* when editing Blade |
| `backend/resources/views/` | Admin Blade | `.cursor/rules/admin-*.mdc` |
| `mobile-app/` | Expo RN iOS/Android | `mobile-app-*.mdc`, AppModal for dialogs |

Surgical edits only. Match neighbors in the same folder. For cross-module impact with `graphify-out/` present: `graphify query` first.
